# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal working material. This repository is PUBLIC, so none of this may be
# committed: _private/ holds unpublished client photo originals, Lightroom
# exports, audit documents, and internal strategy notes. It is also blocked from
# the live site by forced 404 rules in _redirects.
#
# The one exception is _private/build/, the image pipeline. It is ordinary build
# tooling with nothing sensitive in it, and the repo would be incomplete without
# the script that generated images/optimized/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_private/*
!_private/build/
_private/build/node_modules/

# Internal SEO tooling and crawl artifacts
.agents/
.seo-audit/

# Project instructions and internal planning documents
CLAUDE.md
ACTION-PLAN.md
AUDIT-PLAN.md
FULL-AUDIT-REPORT.md
SEO-REPORT.html
seo-audit-report.md
seo-audit.js
blog-gap-report.md
photography-blog-instructions.md
skills-lock.json
docs/

# Isolated workspaces for plan execution (superpowers subagent-driven-development)
.worktrees/
.superpowers/

# Editor / backup cruft
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# Python virtualenvs and caches
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Node. Dependencies are installed OUTSIDE this folder (~/.visualsbyjoshua-build)
# because the project lives in iCloud Drive, and a node_modules tree here gets
# torn apart by sync: it produced "sharp 2" and "semver 2" conflict copies and a
# sharp install with no package.json.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.npm/

# Netlify CLI state
.netlify/

# Third-party clone with its own git remote (Bhanunamikaze/Agentic-SEO-Skill)
Agentic-SEO-Skill
